description = "Snaggletooth, a clean-room, MIT-licensed implementation of the Super Nintendo Entertainment System. The core hands the frontend every frame the console draws, on the GPU by default, its stereo sound at 32 kHz, two controller ports and the cartridge's battery save, and offers core options for the aspect, interlaced pictures, the region and where the console runs its work, Game Genie, Pro Action Replay and raw cheat codes, a memory map for achievements, and save states for rewind, run-ahead and netplay."
